      "content": "Yes—we can include the smart watch and the e-reader **as long as they’re in the same order** you’re returning (and the order status is **delivered**).\n\nPlease send:\n1) your **order ID** (e.g., `#W0000000`), and  \n2) the **four item IDs** you want to return:\n   - 2 skateboard item IDs  \n   - 1 smart watch item ID  \n   - 1 e-reader item ID\n\nOnce you provide those, I’ll confirm the return breakdown and then ask you to confirm (**yes**) before submitting the refund request to your **credit card**.",
